# Bandit's Talent level 3: "At the beginning of your draw step, draw an additional card for each opponent who has one or
# fewer cards in hand." Bot1 reaches level 3 on turn 1 (Black Lotus pays the Class and level 2, four Moxen level 3) and
# empties its hand. Bot2 mulligans to three Mountains, the enters trigger takes two, and after turn 2 (a draw and a land
# played) it holds one card, "one or fewer": in Bot1's turn-3 draw step Bot1 draws its card and one more. Bot2's turn-2
# upkeep at level 2 cost it 2 life with the single card it held.

